{
  "id": 1114,
  "description": "## Calmshore\nCalmshore is a casual, non-competitive guild with no strict contribution requirements.\n\nWe accept players who enjoy relaxed incremental gameplay and want access to basic guild activities and mechanics (raid, challenge, repair maintenance, energizing Pools bonus, guild slayer) without pressure.  \n\nWe expect members to participate or contribute at their own pace — every little bit helps.\n\nJoining Requirement: Combat Lv. 50\n\nDue to prolonged non-participation from past members, members are now required to participate in any guild activity at least once every 3 weeks.\n\nKick: After 4 days of profile inactivity or 3 weeks of guild inactivity.\nYou will be sent a final notice before being kicked.\n\nRaid: 2x Daily - Discord has role ping.  \nOrbit of the Forgotton (Combat Lv.80) (60 minutes) - Celestial Observatory\n\n1st Raid: PST 5pm, CST 7pm, EST 8pm, UTC 1am, AWST 9am\n2nd Raid: PST 6am, CST 8am, EST 9am, UTC 2pm, AWST 10pm\n\nEnergizing Pools activated on SAT &amp; SUN (America) / SUN &amp; MON (Eurasia) after 1st raid.  \n(SAT/SUN) PST 6pm, CST 8pm, EST 9pm, (SUN/MON) UTC 2am, AWST 10am  \n\nOur Discord: https://discord.gg/Np2jQR4BCz\n\nCurrent Goal:  \nComplete Guild Challenges to afford weekly Guild Raids &amp; Energizing Pools  \nMaintain Repair Material in Stockpile\n\n[HISTORY]  \n20251212 Guild Established, transferred from &#039;Harem Kings&#039; Guild  \n20260207 Guild Lv. 60  \n20260323 Guild Lv. 70  \n20260403 Built Energizing Pools  \n20260608 Guild Lv. 80  \n20260803 Guild Lv. 85  \n\n### | GUILD BOARD |\n\n[GUILD MARKS]  \nEach completed Guild Challenge add 1 mark. A raid cost 3 marks &amp; Energizing Pools  cost 5 marks per activation.\n\n[CONTRIBUTION]  \nContribute at your own pace.  \n- Join a raid. (Lv. 70 raid rewards 2.1k gold, 23k Combat EXP, 25k Guild Mastery EXP)\n- Contribute to Guild Challenge. We appreciate all the help we can get.\n- Deposit to Stockpile to repair guild components as soon as possible to save cost.\n- Guild Slayer. Join us in hunting for shards!\n\n[REPAIR &amp; STOCKPILE]\nGuild components are best repair at near 80%\n\nMission Table (Stockpile quantity on 23 Nov 26)  \n754 Oak Log (10575)  \n754 Birch Log (28291)  \n754 Banyan Log (26933)  \n1,006 Willow Log (9063)  \n754 Mahogany Log (14185)  \n754 Lead Bar (9861)  \n754 Steel Bar (3728)  \nRepair Stock: 4x\n\nEnergizing Pools  \n2,500 Spruce Log (1765)**  \n2,500 Maple Log (22796)  \n1,500 Mystical Log (8569)  \n1,500 Iron Bar (6007)  \n1,500 Mercury Bar (3985)  \n1,500 Uranium Bar (6387)  \nRepair Stock: 0x\n\n| Posted on 20261123 |\n\nValla has joined us last week!\n\nOur Guild has started Guild Slayer as part of the activity last week. We have around 3-4 members participate in Guild Slayer Contract. Currently, there are two of us that are capable of renewing the contract we&#039;ll try to do that every day.\n\nBased on what we experimented so far, the first 3 Guild Contracts - Lv. 52 Wraith, Lv. 54 Moose, Lv. 58 Golem (all are Skyreach Peak monster)- is free and do not need Guild Mark. This is possible because Guild Slayer contract could only be generated starting at Lv. 50, we are allowed to set a limit on level when generating random contract. Simply setting level limit to Lv58 will generate the first 3 contracts of these same monsters every time.\n\nI have created a guild-slayer channel in Discord. Feel free to coordinate this activity there. So far, we have tried to pursue it individually and able to reached T2/T3 rewards.\n\nFIoFoxBR is very active and regularly form/join a team to pursue Team Contract as well as Personal Contract to maximize shards gain. \n\nThanks for completing our Guild Challenges in the past two weeks:\nWrenidall, Yaalt, Eiruna, Minutiae, ShadowVoid, Ridiculous, Moosashi, YapaLeno, Owaeka, zerokai, , Prosektikos, Kroben, grumpy, Snuggles,\n\nThanks for filling our resources for repairs!\nYaalt\n\nStockpile list has been updated, we are lacking in Spruce Log but it&#039;s not urgent as I have them stocked personally.",
